{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"La Fabrique des pandémies","Dengue, Chikungunya, Covid-19, Sida, Ebola : le nombre de maladies émergentes — jusqu'alors inconnues — a explosé ces quarante dernières années. La plupart d'entre elles sont des zoonoses, des maladies infectieuses transmises aux hommes par les animaux. Dans ce documentaire événement, la comédienne Juliette Binoche cherche à saisir les causes de cette \"épidémie de pandémies\". Elle part à la rencontre de scientifiques du monde entier pour comprendre quels sont les liens entre la santé humaine et la santé des écosystèmes.",[4,5,6],"celebrity","ecology","covid-19",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":27,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":38,"awards":66,"tags":3},"Film","FR2022_086","fr2022-086-la-fabrique-des-pandemies",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2022-05-18",2022,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":26},"Marie-Monique Robin","marie-monique-robin",1960,0,"Female identifying","France",[],[28,29],"Documentary – Expository mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://www.ird.fr/sites/ird_fr/files/styles/medium_300/public/2022-04/Affiche%20LFDP%20A3%20Logos.jpg?itok=73IcCHRJ","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=goSMydAsF1k",{"native":2,"english":12},[35],{"country":25,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[],[39,62],{"person":40,"role":61},{"id":41,"slug":42,"name":41,"birthYear":43,"deathYear":23,"gender":24,"nationality":25,"awards":44},"Juliette Binoche","juliette-binoche",1964,[45,51,55,58],{"film":46,"year":47,"award":48,"category":49,"result":50},"it2015-035-l-attesa",2016,"Premio David di Donatello","Best Actress Female","Nominated",{"film":52,"year":53,"award":54,"category":49,"result":50},"fr2022-005